@startuml

participant IMetadataServiceAidl as aidl
participant Service as service
participant Domain as domain
participant Repository as repo
participant Data as data
participant "ConnectedRadioClient/\nGracenoteService" as providers

aidl -> service: AIDL request **[1]**
service -> domain: forward request **[2]**
domain -> repo: query **[3]**
repo -> data: retrieve cached data **[4]**
data --> repo: cached result **[5]**

opt no data cached\n or outdated

	repo -> data:
	data -> providers: request data **[6]**
	providers --> data:
	data --> repo: back-end result **[7]**

else data cached

	repo --> domain: cached result **[8]**
	domain --> service: cached result **[9]**
	service --> aidl: AIDL response **[10]**

	repo -> data:
	data -> providers: check data status **[11]**
	providers --> data: back-end result **[12]**
	data -> repo:

end

opt new back-end data available

	repo -> data: store in cache **[13]**
	repo --> domain: online result **[14]**
	domain --> service: online result **[15]**
	service --> aidl: AIDL response **[16]**

end

@enduml